OL,3,AStudent movement takes Serbia's VuDMiDG
OL,4,Ato the wire in neck-and-neck election
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has been selected as top candidate
OL,7,Ffor an opposition movement posing the
OL,8,Fmost serious challenge to VuDMiDG since
OL,9,Fthe Serbian Progressive Party (SNS)
OL,10,Fentered government in 2012.
OL,12,FThe Student List has emerged from
OL,13,Falmost two years of anti-corruption
OL,14,Fprotests led by young Serbians,
OL,15,Foutraged by the deaths of 16 people
OL,16,Fwhen a railway station's canopy
OL,17,Fcollapsed in Serbia's second city Novi
OL,18,FSad.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
